# oracle: Widom insertion alongside NVE dynamics; the temporary probe must not perturb the trajectory
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 single 1.0 1.0 1.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 3.0 3.0 3.0 units box
create_atoms 2 single 2.0 4.0 2.0 units box
mass 1 1.0
mass 2 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff 1 2 1.5 0.8
pair_coeff 2 2 0.5 0.88
velocity all create 1.0 87287
fix 1 all nve
fix w all widom 1 2 2 12345 1.0
timestep 0.002
thermo_style custom step temp pe etotal f_w[1] f_w[2] f_w[3]
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 1
run 8
